/-! Sch12's perfectoid `K`-algebras are perfectoid Tate rings with a continuous `K`-algebra
structure (P1 `Perfectoid.PerfectoidAlgebra`), and its perfectoid affinoid `K`-algebras are the
objects of `Under` of the pair `(K, K⁺₀)` in `PerfectoidSpace.affinoidPerfectoidEquiv.PairCat`,
`K⁺₀` the smallest ring of integral elements; no condition `K° ⊆ R⁺` is imposed. -/

-- PerfectoidSpace.overPerfectoidFieldEquiv: not stated here; needs `Perfd` and Sch12's category of
--   perfectoid spaces over `K` (supplier: PerfectoidSpaces:P2/perfectoid-space, AdicSpaces Layer
--   5). Sch12's perfectoid spaces over `K` form a category equivalent to `Perfd/Spa(K, K⁺₀)`, with
--   Sch12's tilt the glued tilt and Sch12's fibre products those of
--   PerfectoidSpaces:P2/fibre-products-of-perfectoid-spaces.

end TauCeti

