-- PerfectoidSpace.IsInjection: not stated here; `Hom(Z, Y) → Hom(Z, X)` injective for every
--   perfectoid space `Z` needs the category of perfectoid spaces (supplier: AdicSpaces Layer 5;
--   PerfectoidSpaces:P2/perfectoid-space). Affinoid core: `IsInjection_affinoid`.
-- PerfectoidSpace.isInjection_iff_mono: not stated here; needs `IsInjection` and the category
--   `PerfectoidSpace` (supplier: AdicSpaces Layer 5).
-- PerfectoidSpace.IsInjection.of_affinoid: not stated here; needs `IsInjection` and open affinoid
--   covers (supplier: AdicSpaces Layer 5). For affinoid source and target the affinoid test
--   objects are the definition of `IsInjection_affinoid`.
-- PerfectoidSpace.isInjection_iff_isIso_diagonal: not stated here; needs fibre products of
--   perfectoid spaces (supplier: PerfectoidSpaces:P2/fibre-products-of-perfectoid-spaces).
-- PerfectoidSpace.IsInjection.id: not stated here; needs `IsInjection` (supplier: AdicSpaces
--   Layer 5).
-- PerfectoidSpace.IsInjection.comp: not stated here; needs `IsInjection` (supplier: AdicSpaces
--   Layer 5).
-- PerfectoidSpace.IsInjection.of_comp: not stated here; needs `IsInjection` (supplier:
--   AdicSpaces Layer 5).
