-- PerfectoidSpace.IsStronglyZariskiClosed: not stated here; a morphism `Z → X` of perfectoid
--   spaces induced by a morphism of affinoid perfectoid pairs needs the anchor's adic spaces
--   (supplier: AdicSpaces Layer 5; PerfectoidSpaces:P2/affinoid-perfectoid-space). Affinoid core:
--   `IsStronglyZariskiClosed_affinoid`.
-- PerfectoidSpace.IsStronglyZariskiClosed.surjective: not stated here; needs
--   `IsStronglyZariskiClosed` (supplier: AdicSpaces Layer 5). Affinoid core: the field
--   `IsStronglyZariskiClosed_affinoid.surjective`.
-- PerfectoidSpace.IsStronglyZariskiClosed.plus_eq: not stated here; needs
--   `IsStronglyZariskiClosed` (supplier: AdicSpaces Layer 5). Affinoid core: the field
--   `IsStronglyZariskiClosed_affinoid.plus_eq`.
-- PerfectoidSpace.IsStronglyZariskiClosed.isClosed_ker: not stated here; needs
