  {D : PairDiagram p I} (c : CompatiblePseudouniformizer D)

/-- P5/limit-cardinal-bounds (affinoid core of `cofilteredLimit.card_lt`, ECD Proposition 6.4):
for `κ` an uncountable strong limit cardinal (a property of the cutoff cardinals of ECD Lemma 4.1,
DiamondsAndVStacks:D0/cutoff-cardinal), `I` with fewer than `μ < κ` morphisms and `|R_i| < κ'`
for some `κ' < κ`: `|colim R_i⁺|`, `|R⁺|`, `|R|` and `|Spa(R, R⁺)|` are `< κ`. -/
theorem cofilteredLimit.card_lt_affinoid {κ μ κ' : Cardinal.{u}} (hκ : κ.IsStrongLimit)
    (hκ₀ : Cardinal.aleph0 < κ) (hI : HasCardinalLT (Arrow I) μ) (hμκ : μ < κ) (hκ'κ : κ' < κ)
    (hR : ∀ i, Cardinal.mk (D.ring.obj (op i)) < κ') :
    Cardinal.mk (plusColimit D) < κ ∧ Cardinal.mk (integral c) < κ ∧
      Cardinal.mk (completedColimit c) < κ ∧
