/-- P6/kappa-small-cover-criterion (d), affinoid core of `isKappaSmall_affinoid_iff`: an affinoid
perfectoid space `Spa(R, R⁺)` is κ-small iff `#R < κ` (ECD Proposition 4.4; the bounds
`mk_spa_lt` and `mk_rationalLoc_le`). -/
theorem isKappaSmall_affinoid_iff_core (hκ : κ.IsStrongLimit) (hκ₀ : ℵ₀ < κ) (P : Pair R) :
    IsKappaSmall_affinoid κ P ↔ #R < κ := sorry

/-- P6/kappa-small-cover-criterion (b), (d), affinoid core of `IsKappaSmall.of_cover`: if
`Spa(R, R⁺)` is covered by finitely many rational subsets `U(Tᵢ/sᵢ)` with `#R⟨Tᵢ/sᵢ⟩ < κ`, then
