/-- P6/kappa-small-closure (a), affinoid core of `IsKappaSmall.isOpen`: a rational subset
`U(T/s)` of a κ-small `Spa(R, R⁺)` is κ-small: `Spa(R⟨T/s⟩, R⟨T/s⟩⁺) ≅ U(T/s) ⊆ Spa(R, R⁺)`, and
rational subsets of `U(T/s)` are rational in `Spa(R, R⁺)` (ECD Proposition 4.4). -/
theorem IsKappaSmall.isOpen_affinoid {P : Pair R} (h : IsKappaSmall_affinoid κ P)
    {D : PairOfDefinition R} (𝔭 : D.Presentation) (hspan : Ideal.span (𝔭.num : Set R) = ⊤) :
    IsKappaSmall_affinoid κ (RationalLoc.pair 𝔭 P) := sorry

