variable (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] {R : Type u} [CommRing R] [UniformSpace R] [IsUniformAddGroup R]
  [IsTopologicalRing R] [IsTateRing R] [CompleteSpace R] [T2Space R] [IsPerfectoidTateRing p R]

/-- P6/kappa-small-tilting: `#R♭ ≤ #R ^ ℵ₀`, `R♭ = lim_{x ↦ x^p} R` being a set of sequences in
`R` (ECD after Lemma 3.10). -/
theorem mk_tilt_le : #(tilt p R) ≤ #R ^ ℵ₀ := sorry

/-- P6/kappa-small-tilting: `#R ≤ #R♭ ^ ℵ₀ · ℵ₀`: as `R°/ϖ ≅ R♭°/ϖ♭` (stage P1
`tilt.sharpQuotEquiv`), every `x ∈ R°` is a convergent sum `∑ₙ cₙ♯ ϖⁿ` with `cₙ ∈ R♭°`, and
`R = ⋃ₙ ϖ⁻ⁿ R°` (ECD after Lemma 3.10). -/
theorem mk_le_tilt : #R ≤ #(tilt p R) ^ ℵ₀ * ℵ₀ := sorry

end TiltCardinality

