-- PerfectoidSpace.isKappaSmall_limit: not stated here; needs cofiltered limits of affinoid
--   perfectoid spaces (supplier: PerfectoidSpaces:P5/cofiltered-limits-of-affinoid-perfectoid-
--   spaces). Affinoid core: `IsUniformlyKappaSmall.completedFilteredColimit_affinoid`.
-- PerfectoidSpace.isKappaSmall_limit_of_cof: not stated here; the same limits (supplier:
--   PerfectoidSpaces:P5/cofiltered-limits-of-affinoid-perfectoid-spaces). Affinoid core:
--   `IsKappaSmall.completedFilteredColimit_of_lt_cof_affinoid`.
-- PerfectoidSpace.exists_not_isKappaSmall_limit: not stated here; (c) the completed union of an
